WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.819
DS-1000 clearly separates models of different strength.

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:07.930
The best public system, Codex-002 in the insertion format,

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:12.325
reaches only forty-three point three percent
average accuracy,

00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:17.500
nontrivial but far from solved, leaving substantial
room for improvement.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.264
Across five models from three families,

00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:26.219
accuracy ranges from seven point four percent up to
forty-three point three percent.

00:00:26.299 --> 00:00:29.905
Insertion format, which supplies right-hand context,

00:00:29.985 --> 00:00:34.867
gives Codex-002 a four point one percent boost over
completion format,

00:00:34.947 --> 00:00:39.120
underscoring the value of infilling for data
science coding.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:45.500
Weaker models such as CodeGen-6B and InCoder-6B
fall below five percent on some libraries.
